      "text": "22 February، 2023\n\nDeir Ezzor, SANA- One citizen martyred and two others in Deir Ezzor were injured on Wednesday at the hands of US occupation- backed QSD militia.\n\n“A group affiliated with QSD militia carried out, at dawn, a raid campaign with the support of US occupation forces in the town of Jadeed Akeidat in the eastern countryside of Deir Ezzor, during which they searched a house in the town and opened fire on its residents, killing the owner of the house and the wounding of two others” local sources stated.\n\n“The militia kidnapped the two injured persons along with three other citizens and transferred them to one of its military headquarters in the area” The sources added.\n\nALI,Baraa\n\ntweet"
    }
  ],
